<Placemark><name>Thumsee bemelegítő kör (11.5 km, 145 m)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Thumsee bemelegítő kör</b> – GENERÁLT NYOMVONAL<br/>Rövid, szállodából induló kör a legközelebbi tóhoz. Kirchbergen át a Thumsee-hez, a tóparton a Seewirtig, és egy másik úton vissza a városba. Ideális érkezésnapi tesztkörnek. (A Listsee felé vezető út meredek, ezért kimaradt.)<br/><br/>Táv: 11.5 km · Szint: 145 m · Max: 589 m · Idő: ~0.8 ó<br/>Nehézség: könnyű · Értékelés: ★★★★☆<br/>Burkolat: aszfalt 94.7%, kemény murva 5.3%, laza/erdei 0.0%, ösvény 0.0%<br/>Indulás: Közvetlenül a szálloda elől indul | Autóval ~8 perc: Parkplatz Seewirt, Thumsee | Vonattal: Bad Reichenhall-Kirchberg (~3 perc Bad Reichenhall Hbf-ről)<br/>Október: A Thumsee körül októberben sok a gyalogos – lassíts a part menti szakaszon. A Saalachsee gátján keskeny az út – lassíts, ha gyalogosok jönnek.]]></description><styleUrl>#konnyu</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>12.88384,47.7269,478 12.88437,47.72662,478 12.88435,47.72641,479 12.88387,47.72612,481 12.8838,47.72566,482 12.88319,47.725,481 12.88225,47.72454,476 12.88132,47.72493,474 12.88082,47.72441,472 12.88023,47.72441,470 12.87903,47.72332,472 12.87791,47.7224,474 12.87719,47.72264,475 12.87621,47.72143,474 12.8759,47.72098,474 12.87513,47.71966,474 12.87491,47.71907,474 12.87404,47.71901,473 12.87399,47.71886,473 12.87321,47.7187,472 12.87299,47.71879,472 12.8712,47.71817,471 12.87077,47.71816,471 12.86883,47.71889,471 12.86759,47.71925,471 12.86644,47.71984,473 12.86492,47.71966,473 12.8629,47.71958,467 12.86102,47.71957,468 12.86107,47.72027,468 12.85953,47.72067,467 12.85797,47.72039,465 12.85593,47.72024,466 12.85498,47.72019,467 12.85285,47.72024,466 12.85079,47.72032,470 12.85078,47.72032,470 12.84971,47.72142,478 12.8493,47.72178,484 12.84849,47.72183,496 12.84757,47.7216,505 12.84805,47.7222,513 12.84776,47.72268,521 12.84574,47.72238,540 12.84384,47.72199,545 12.84271,47.72192,549 12.84081,47.72242,558 12.84063,47.72