<Placemark><name>Untersberg-kör (48.0 km, 539 m)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Untersberg-kör</b> – GENERÁLT NYOMVONAL<br/>A környék egyik legszebb klasszikusa: az Untersberg teljes megkerülése. Hallthurmon át Bischofswiesenbe és Berchtesgadenbe, onnan az Almbachklamm és Marktschellenberg felé, majd St. Leonhardon, Grödigen és Fürstenbrunnon át Großgmain felé zárod a kört. Két országon át, sziklafalak alatt.<br/><br/>Táv: 48.0 km · Szint: 539 m · Max: 707 m · Idő: ~3.1 ó<br/>Nehézség: könnyű · Értékelés: ★★★★★<br/>Burkolat: aszfalt 89.8%, kemény murva 10.1%, laza/erdei 0.0%, ösvény 0.2%<br/>Indulás: Közvetlenül a szálloda elől indul | Autóval ~10 perc: Wanderparkplatz Hallthurm | Vonattal: Berchtesgaden Hbf (~30 perc Bad Reichenhall Hbf-ről)<br/>Október: Berchtesgaden–Marktschellenberg között a B305 rövid szakaszán forgalom van. Határátlépés Marktschellenbergnél – személyi igazolvány.]]></description><styleUrl>#konnyu</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>12.88384,47.7269,478 12.88439,47.72655,479 12.88387,47.72612,482 12.88385,47.72585,484 12.8841,47.72577,485 12.88522,47.72601,493 12.8856,47.72597,496 12.8864,47.72517,511 12.88686,47.72389,525 12.88762,47.72328,529 12.88916,47.723,530 12.89005,47.72229,529 12.89224,47.72215,523 12.89385,47.72202,526 12.89413,47.72057,537 12.89422,47.72014,538 12.89448,47.71985,539 12.89636,47.7202,542 12.89702,47.71953,546 12.89843,47.71997,547 12.90038,47.71948,544 12.90182,47.7192,543 12.90381,47.71899,539 12.90463,47.7189,537 12.90663,47.71831,542 12.90738,47.71807,545 12.9094,47.71781,550 12.91139,47.71736,556 12.91229,47.71724,558 12.91412,47.71641,562 12.91589,47.71554,570 12.91645,47.7153,571 12.91826,47.71456,583 12.92022,47.71382,591 12.9218,47.71317,594 12.92282,47.71249,598 12.92394,47.71125,606 12.92414,47.71101,608 12.92446,47.71036,612 12.92608,47.71017,621 12.92766,47.70949,636 12.92788,47.70918,643 12.92798,47.7082,662 12.92952,47.70747,677 12.93013,47.70608,682 12.93036,47.70553,686 12.9317