<Placemark><name>Saalach–Mußbach kör (33.1 km, 403 m)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Saalach–Mußbach kör</b> – GENERÁLT NYOMVONAL<br/>Csendes völgyi kör a Saalach mentén délre. A Saalachsee gátja után a régi völgyi utakon Jettenbergbe, majd a Mußbach erdei murvaútján kapaszkodsz, és a folyó túlsó partján gurulsz vissza. Kevés szint, sok murva – kezdőknek is jó.<br/><br/>Táv: 33.1 km · Szint: 403 m · Max: 589 m · Idő: ~2.3 ó<br/>Nehézség: könnyű · Értékelés: ★★★☆☆<br/>Burkolat: aszfalt 65.4%, kemény murva 34.6%, laza/erdei 0.0%, ösvény 0.0%<br/>Indulás: Közvetlenül a szálloda elől indul | Autóval ~8 perc: Parkplatz Seewirt, Thumsee | Vonattal: Bad Reichenhall-Kirchberg (~3 perc Bad Reichenhall Hbf-ről)<br/>Október: A Saalach menti utat esőzés után helyenként elmossa a víz – ilyenkor maradj a B21 melletti kerékpárúton.]]></description><styleUrl>#konnyu</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>12.88384,47.7269,478 12.88437,47.72662,478 12.88435,47.72641,479 12.88387,47.72612,481 12.8838,47.72566,482 12.88319,47.725,481 12.88225,47.72454,476 12.88132,47.72493,474 12.88082,47.72441,472 12.88023,47.72441,470 12.87903,47.72332,472 12.87791,47.7224,474 12.87719,47.72264,475 12.87621,47.72143,474 12.8759,47.72098,474 12.87513,47.71966,474 12.87491,47.71907,474 12.87404,47.71901,473 12.87399,47.71886,473 12.87321,47.7187,472 12.87299,47.71879,472 12.87133,47.71821,471 12.87115,47.7172,474 12.87183,47.71662,477 12.87194,47.71633,479 12.87061,47.71518,493 12.87047,47.71509,495 12.86854,47.71461,506 12.86806,47.71442,507 12.86757,47.7141,504 12.86713,47.71342,500 12.8661,47.71318,493 12.86541,47.71266,492 12.86337,47.7126,503 12.8615,47.71208,527 12.86053,47.71191,523 12.85963,47.71162,516 12.8579,47.71077,515 12.85732,47.71049,520 12.85538,47.71002,530 12.85474,47.70978,526 12.85308,47.70902,511 12.85274,47.70878,509 12.85185,47.70747,505 12.85125,47.7065,502 12.84982,47.70537,503 12.84909,47.70474,502 12.84846,47.70358,499 12.84734,47.70227,497 12.84626,47.