<Placemark><name>Lofer – Vorderkaserklamm – Unken (Saalach-völgy) (35.3 km, 442 m)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Lofer – Vorderkaserklamm – Unken (Saalach-völgy)</b> – GENERÁLT NYOMVONAL<br/>Loferből St. Martinon át a Vorderkaserklamm szurdokához (büfé, rövid gyalogos kör a szurdokban), majd vissza Loferbe és a Saalach-völgyi bringaúton (Tauernradweg) Unkenig és vissza. Lankás, a Loferer Steinberge falai alatt. A Loferer Alm meredek (12% feletti) hegyi útja kimaradt.<br/><br/>Táv: 35.3 km · Szint: 442 m · Max: 738 m · Idő: ~2.4 ó<br/>Nehézség: könnyű · Értékelés: ★★★★☆<br/>Burkolat: aszfalt 77.7%, kemény murva 21.8%, laza/erdei 0.0%, ösvény 0.5%<br/>Indulás: Autóval ~30 perc: Lofer, Parkplatz Zentrum | Vonattal: Bad Reichenhall Hbf (gyalog/bringával 0,5 km a szállodától)<br/>Október: A Saalach-völgyi bringaúton hétvégén sok a kiránduló – csengess. A Vorderkaserklamm és a büfé általában október közepéig nyitva.]]></description><styleUrl>#konnyu</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>12.6953,47.58671,627 12.695,47.58645,627 12.69485,47.5865,627 12.6947,47.58609,627 12.69384,47.58637,627 12.69359,47.58581,626 12.69324,47.58576,625 12.69382,47.58446,624 12.69381,47.58444,623 12.69469,47.58404,623 12.69465,47.58353,622 12.69527,47.58353,623 12.69569,47.58324,623 12.6963,47.58319,623 12.69745,47.58278,624 12.69788,47.5824,624 12.69821,47.58099,627 12.69826,47.5809,627 12.69897,47.58078,628 12.69909,47.57927,627 12.69909,47.57908,626 12.699,47.57763,628 12.69892,47.57657,629 12.69914,47.5757,628 12.69999,47.5744,629 12.70057,47.57379,631 12.70141,47.57244,630 12.70225,47.57112,628 12.70315,47.56976,629 12.70404,47.56859,629 12.70449,47.56767,630 12.70553,47.5665,633 12.70585,47.56593,634 12.70683,47.56553,636 12.70899,47.56512,636 12.70982,47.56491,635 12.71165,47.56425,636 12.71283,47.5635,637 12.71354,47.56339,638 12.71429,47.5621,641 12.71483,47.56148,640 12.71641,47.56049,652 12.71708,47.56009,653 12.71815,47.5588,650 12.7192,47.55778,658 12.7208